  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uba166d98\" id=\"uba166d98\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1699508489373-055826a8-9bd4-4b0a-aa42-c1961af32864.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub0e66e1a-e556-40a3-8c89-74c28c78476%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4fd20200-3029-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A223.63635878917611%2C%22height%22%3A281%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A10090%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A246%2C%22originHeight%22%3A309%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98.%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A24%2C%22y%22%3A5%2C%22width%22%3A75%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C2%2CR0%22%2C%22x%22%3A167%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C2R1%22%2C%22x%22%3A169%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CL%2CRO%22%2C%22x%22%3A100%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C0.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A31%2C%22y%22%3A175%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLR1%22%2C%22x%22%3A102%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CO%2CNL%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A117%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CO%2CRO%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C1R2%22%2C%22x%22%3A100%2C%22y%22%3A175%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22C2R2%22%2C%22x%22%3A168%2C%22y%22%3A176%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%22%2C%22x%22%3A205%2C%22y%22%3A6%2C%22width%22%3A22%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d1d2cf%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ued6f4b59%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6737a0a4\" id=\"u6737a0a4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0a1922d\" id=\"ud0a1922d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">网格布局可以将项目排列成具有行或列（轨道）的二维“表格”。 该项目可以跨越多个列或行。 轨道的大小可以设置为像素、最大项目（LV_GRID_CONTENT）或“空闲单元”（FR）以按比例分</span><span data-lake-id=\"u897a61ef\" id=\"u897a61ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">配空闲空间。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0e3bcde5\" id=\"u0e3bcde5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b028033\" id=\"u5b028033\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">要使对象成为网格容器，请调用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u8c69cfe1\" id=\"u8c69cfe1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua4f5cf9d\" id=\"ua4f5cf9d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> lv_obj_set_layout(obj, LV_LAYOUT_GRID)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1d69addb\" id=\"u1d69addb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5b2722fe\" id=\"u5b2722fe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u317bcaf1\" id=\"u317bcaf1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">请注意，LVGL 的网格布局功能需要通过</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf898a9ef\" id=\"uf898a9ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u82652d86\" id=\"u82652d86\"><span data-lake-id=\"uceae9bfa\" id=\"uceae9bfa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">lv_conf.h</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufa2f32d0\" id=\"ufa2f32d0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 中的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf019bf6f\" id=\"uf019bf6f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e99283b\" id=\"u9e99283b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">LV_USE_GRID</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u66e79471\" id=\"u66e79471\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u807bafa5\" id=\"u807bafa5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">全局启用。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"Uh2bq\" id=\"Uh2bq\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub365f204\" id=\"ub365f204\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">1. 常用方法</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u1b76402e\" id=\"u1b76402e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6d95b3ce\" id=\"u6d95b3ce\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">创建grid布局:</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lv_obj_t%20*%20lv_obj_create(lv_obj_t%20*%20parent)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zvoZX%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3001f367\" id=\"u3001f367\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef3c7b55\" id=\"uef3c7b55\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">网格布局列描述数组:</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_obj_set_style_grid_column_dsc_array(%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_t%20*%20obj%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20lv_coord_t%20value%5B%5D%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_style_selector_t%20selector)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XQurE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"uc73dd409\" id=\"uc73dd409\"><p data-lake-id=\"u852b74a3\" id=\"u852b74a3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4357d01\" id=\"ud4357d01\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数1:布局objects</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub85a566c\" id=\"ub85a566c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u90ae135e\" id=\"u90ae135e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数2:行描述数组</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u40400dcc\" id=\"u40400dcc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55a943ee\" id=\"u55a943ee\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数3:样式相关,默认0即可</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"ufd8071ae\" id=\"ufd8071ae\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2bf23f33\" id=\"u2bf23f33\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">网格布局行描述数组:</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_obj_set_style_grid_row_dsc_array(%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_obj_t%20*%20obj%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20const%20lv_coord_t%20value%5B%5D%2C%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20lv_style_selector_t%20selector)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EzSDD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ue1c28935\" id=\"ue1c28935\"><p data-lake-id=\"u22fac66e\" id=\"u22fac66e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc08f8424\" id=\"uc08f8424\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数1:布局objects</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u348abe9a\" id=\"u348abe9a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1778f670\" id=\"u1778f670\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数2:列描述数组</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u41abc5c3\" id=\"u41abc5c3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub4991c46\" id=\"ub4991c46\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数3:样式相关,默认0即可</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"ud7c1f38a\" id=\"ud7c1f38a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ueae618d2\" id=\"ueae618d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">设置网格布局:</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_obj_set_layout(lv_obj_t%20*%20obj%2C%20uint32_t%20layout)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rN0pU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u81ea856a\" id=\"u81ea856a\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub3ab9e60\" id=\"ub3ab9e60\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57f55326\" id=\"u57f55326\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数1:布局objects</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u675a4e9b\" id=\"u675a4e9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8155245f\" id=\"u8155245f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数2:grid布局   默认:</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubca85527\" id=\"ubca85527\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufaf7cdd7\" id=\"ufaf7cdd7\">LV_LAYOUT_GRID </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u38655eb0\" id=\"u38655eb0\"> flex布局也可以是:</span><code data-lake-id=\"u85c6f2ec\" id=\"u85c6f2ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u37c9d32c\" id=\"u37c9d32c\">LV_LAYOUT_FLEX</span></code></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id=\"u41fb54c7\" id=\"u41fb54c7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud512e082\" id=\"ud512e082\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">手动添加子对象:</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22void%20lv_obj_set_grid_cell(lv_obj_t%20*%20child%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lv_grid_align_t%20column_align%2C%20uint8_t%20col_pos%2C%20uint8_t%20col_span%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20lv_grid_align_t%20row_align%2C%20%20%20%20uint8_t%20row_pos%2C%20uint8_t%20row_span)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CoRRq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"ufcc1c4a1\" id=\"ufcc1c4a1\"><p data-lake-id=\"u5e410bb6\" id=\"u5e410bb6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d634914\" id=\"u5d634914\">column_align</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub229595d\" id=\"ub229595d\">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u620c93da\" id=\"u620c93da\">row_align</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1ac0b342\" id=\"u1ac0b342\">确定子对象对齐方式:可选:</span></p><ul list=\"uf54df697\"><li fid=\"ub1f71304\" data-lake-id=\"u0e257fa6\" id=\"u0e257fa6\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud8e4de18\" id=\"ud8e4de18\"><span data-lake-id=\"u388e9bbf\" id=\"u388e9bbf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(73, 73, 73)\">LV_GRID_ALIGN_START</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5f1192b2\" id=\"u5f1192b2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(73, 73, 73)\">：</span><span data-lake-id=\"u70cb8e70\" id=\"u70cb8e70\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(123, 127, 130)\">水平方向左，垂直方向上</span></li><li fid=\"ub1f71304\" data-lake-id=\"u763d7548\" id=\"u763d7548\"><code data-lake-id=\"ufeb29042\" id=\"ufeb29042\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9da93c7\" id=\"ud9da93c7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(73, 73, 73)\">LV_GRID_ALIGN_CENTER</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1faae964\" id=\"u1faae964\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(73, 73, 73)\">：</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6b2bd2b2\" id=\"u6b2bd2b2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(123, 127, 130)\">居中</span></li><li fid=\"ub1f71304\" data-lake-id=\"u1ec483b7\" id=\"u1ec483b7\"><code data-lake-id=\"u4fb29b09\" id=\"u4fb29b09\"><span data-lake-id=\"u945f8149\" id=\"u945f8149\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(73, 73, 73)\">LV_GRID_ALIGN_END</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6f83fc12\" id=\"u6f83fc12\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(73, 73, 73)\">：</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7ae7febb\" id=\"u7ae7febb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(123, 127, 130)\">水平方向右，垂直方向下</span></li><li fid=\"ub1f71304\" data-lake-id=\"ub27bcd4e\" id=\"ub27bcd4e\"><code data-lake-id=\"u79bb91c2\" id=\"u79bb91c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18cdd8be\" id=\"u18cdd8be\">LV_GRID_ALIGN_STRETCH</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5f223f1e\" id=\"u5f223f1e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(73, 73, 73)\">：</span><span data-lake-id=\"u21450bde\" id=\"u21450bde\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(123, 127, 130)\">网格内的控件尺寸延展至网格大小</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u4531bbf1\" id=\"u4531bbf1\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud12e4daa\" id=\"ud12e4daa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u423a14f4\" id=\"u423a14f4\">column_pos</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uea07db3c\" id=\"uea07db3c\"> &amp; </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub155a5bb\" id=\"ub155a5bb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04672041\" id=\"u04672041\">row_pos </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u58ee6ea3\" id=\"u58ee6ea3\">确定放置的单元格位置</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u135befaa\" id=\"u135befaa\"><code data-lake-id=\"u8e7147a9\" id=\"u8e7147a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47df6441\" id=\"u47df6441\">column_span</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u568a1d90\" id=\"u568a1d90\"> &amp; </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2d9d41dd\" id=\"u2d9d41dd\"><span data-lak